    "name": "Brocade Fabric OS REST Chassis Zoning API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Brocade Fabric OS (FOS) REST API is a RESTCONF (RFC 8040) interface built on YANG 1.1 data models for managing Brocade SAN switches. It exposes operations for authentication, chassis, ports, zoning, security, and monitoring on Fabric OS 8.2.0 and later. Login returns an Authorization token used for subsequent calls.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Brocade Fabric OS REST API",
